ready: 1
kind: system
id: sys.cloud
name: Kernle cloud
role: Stores a synced copy of the owner's stacks and serves changes to their other machines
system_kind: external
connections:
  - to: sys.daemon
    label: Push and pull over HTTPS
    direction: both
notes: >-
  The service is outside this package. Kernle specifies only the client side:
  the account, the per-stack queue, push and pull, conflicts, and deletion
  propagation.
